    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's more than just feeling disconnected. it's like i'm just taking up space. i look at these miles of nothing and i realize nobody's waiting for me to arrive, and nobody's gonna notice if i don't. it feels like i'm already gone, just... waiting for my body to catch up. like everything is just pointless.",
