      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how isolating and heavy those thoughts are right now, and that feeling of wanting the struggle to just end sounds incredibly painful. Please know that even when surrounded by vast emptiness, there are people who deeply care and want to help you carry this weight. You can connect with trained individuals anonymously by calling or texting 988 anytime in the US and Canada. Please make that call; they are ready to listen to exactly what you are feeling.",
